# Tracked deliberately, not ignored:
#   models/          ~48 KB, the exact models behind the reported metrics
#   reports/         Phase I deliverables (results, metrics, figures)
#   data/samples/    4 KB demo fixture, regenerated deterministically (seed 42)
#
# data/processed/ is 67 MB and regenerable from data/raw/ via
# notebooks/01_preprocessing.ipynb. Uncomment to stop tracking new changes to it;
# note this does NOT untrack what is already committed, and the existing blobs
# stay in history until it is rewritten.
